ect":[0,0,0],"share":[null,null,null],"closedShare":null,"gap":{"cells":0,"directDeals":0,"median":null,"low":null,"high":null,"lowerShare":null}},"종로구":{"deals":[0,0,0],"direct":[0,0,0],"share":[null,null,null],"closedShare":null,"gap":{"cells":0,"directDeals":0,"median":null,"low":null,"high":null,"lowerShare":null}},"중구":{"deals":[0,0,0],"direct":[0,0,0],"share":[null,null,null],"closedShare":null,"gap":{"cells":0,"directDeals":0,"median":null,"low":null,"high":null,"lowerShare":null}},"중랑구":{"deals":[0,0,0],"direct":[0,0,0],"share":[null,null,null],"closedShare":null,"gap":{"cells":0,"directDeals":0,"median":null,"low":null,"high":null,"lowerShare":null}}},"heading":{"ko":"직거래는 얼마나 낮게 신고되나","en":"How low are direct deals filed?"},"lead":{"ko":"2026년 8월~2026년 8월 서울 아파트 매매 가운데 중개사 없이 신고된 직거래는 50%였습니다. 달마다 50~50% 사이였습니다. 같은 단지·같은 전용면적에서 견주면 직거래는 중개거래보다 중앙값 10% 낮게 신고됐습니다(90% 구간 -10~-10%, 양쪽 모두 3건 이상인 20칸). 그 칸의 100%에서 직거래가 더 낮았습니다.","en":"From Aug 2026~Aug 2026, direct deals — filed without an agent — were 50% of Seoul apartment sales, between 50% and 50% in any one month. Within the same complex and unit size, direct deals were filed a median 10% below agent-brokered ones (90% range -10~-10%, across 20 unit types with at least 3 of each), and came in lower in 100% of those unit types."},"note":{"ko":"직거래는 공인중개사 없이 당사자끼리 신고한 거래입니다. 가족 간 거래, 분양·조합 정산, 모르는 사람끼리 시세대로 한 거래가 모두 같은 표시로 들어오고, 신고 자료에는 사유가 없어 왜 낮은지는 알 수 없습니다. 이 격차로 어느 한 거래가 특수관계 거래라거나 부당했다고 말할 수 없습니다. 칸은 직거래·중개거래가 각각 3건 이상인 같은 구·단지·전용면적만 세고(시세 화면의 칸 문턱), 자치구는 칸이 20개 이상일 때만 격차를 적습니다(층 격차 화면과 같은 문턱). 못 미치면 비웁니다. 두 해를 한 칸에 담아 그 사이 시세 변화는 통제되지 않습니다. 2026년 9월·2026년 10월은 계약 뒤 30일까지 신고가 들어오는 덜 찬 달이라 표시만 하고 비중 합계에서 뺍니다.","en":"A direct deal is one the parties filed without a licensed agent. Transfers within a family, settlements with a developer or redevelopment association and ordinary sales between strangers all carry the same mark, and the filing gives no reason, so why they come in lower is unknown. This gap does not show that any one deal was between related parties or improper. A unit type counts only when it has at least 3 direct and 3 brokered deals (the same floor as the price screens), and a district gets a gap only with 20 or more unit types (the same as the floor-gap screen); the rest are left blank. The two years go into one comparison, so price movement within that time is not controlled. Sep 2026 and Oct 2026 are still filling up — filings arrive for 30 days after a contract — so they are marked and left out of the shares."},"table":{"ko":"<thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">자치구</th><th scope=\"col\">직거래</th><th scope=\"col\">격차</th><th scope=\"col\">90% 구간</th><th scope=\"col\">칸</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>서울</td><td>50%</td><td>-10%</td><td>-10~-10%</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>강남구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>강동구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>강북구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>강서구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>관악구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>광진구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>구로구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>금천구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>노원구</td><td>50%</td><td>-10%</td><td>-10~-10%</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>도봉구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>동대문구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>동작구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>마포구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>서대문구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>서초구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>성동구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>성북구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>송파구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>양천구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>영등포구</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-